# V1 boundaries

Before adding features, read [docs/scope.md](../../docs/scope.md).

**Out of scope:** PIN, backup/restore, overspend alerts, budget vs actual, wallet payments, login, sync, team permissions, subscription UI.

**In scope highlights:** auto workspace; client + auto project; vouchers; archive-not-delete; client & supplier statements; edit/delete transactions locally.

Client page = primary project UI for the auto-created project. Adding a client must not add extra project-creation steps.
